<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Datacraft posts half year net profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Datacraft posts half year net profit.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating		     profit 5.18 vs loss 0.75</p>
<p>    Net			     profit 1.58 vs loss 2.21</p>
<p>    Sales				  121.13 vs 94.72</p>
<p>    Other income			   1.70 vs 1.29</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		     gain 1.55 vs loss 2.18</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs loss 1.07</p>
<p>    Tax			    expense 0.93 vs credit 1.18</p>
<p>    Interest				 1.31 vs 0.64</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   3.39 vs 3.00</p>
<p>    Minorities			     2.67 vs 1.57</p>
<p>NOTE: Datacraft Ltd is a data communications equipment manufacturer, importer and designer.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
